lude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of the first element of largest absolute value, or of the first `NaN`, as in the\nreference BLAS, but starting at `0`; `none` for the empty vector.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax?","kind":"def","line":629,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L629-L634"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.val_iamax\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">val_iamax</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Ne\">≠</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">↑<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax\">iamax</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">h</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!\">iamax!</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.val_iamax","kind":"theorem","line":627,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.val_iamax","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L627-L627"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">iamax</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Ne\">≠</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> := by grind)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of the first element of largest absolute value, or of the first `NaN`, of a nonempty\nvector, as in the reference BLAS, but starting at `0`. It is `iamax! x`, as a `Fin n`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax","kind":"def","line":620,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L620-L625"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!_lt\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">iamax!_lt</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Ne\">≠</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!\">iamax!</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`iamax! x` is an index of `x`, unless `x` is empty.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!_lt","kind":"theorem","line":615,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!_lt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L615-L618"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">iamax!_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!\">iamax!</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Fold.html#Nat.fold\">fold</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxStep\">iamaxStep</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!_eq","kind":"theorem","line":591,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L591-L595"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">iamax!</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of the first element of largest absolute value, or of the first `NaN`, as in the\nreference BLAS (after LAPACK 3.12.1, which skips a `NaN` unless it is the first element). Unlike\nthe reference BLAS, the index starts at `0`, and it is `0` for the empty vector. `iamax` and\n`iamax?` return the same index as a `Fin n`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!","kind":"def","line":580,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamax!","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L580-L589"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxLoop\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">iamaxLoop</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ho</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.off\">off</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#Nat.toUSize\">toUSize</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">o</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hc</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.inc\">inc</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#Nat.toUSize\">toUSize</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.data\">data</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hm</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The loop of `iamax` from the index `i`, up to the bound `m`, which is `n`, with the index `k` and\nabsolute value `a` of the first largest element so far. It keeps them in two loop variables rather\nthan a pair, which would be allocated at every new largest element. It returns at the first `NaN`,\nas the reference BLAS does, since nothing replaces it, so it checks for a `NaN` only at a new\nlargest element.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxLoop","kind":"def","line":493,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxLoop","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L493-L512"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxStep\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">iamaxStep</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One step of `iamax`: the index and absolute value of the first largest element so far, or of the\nfirst `NaN`. An element replaces the largest so far unless it is `≤` it, so a `NaN` replaces it,\nand nothing replaces a `NaN`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxStep","kind":"def","line":483,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.iamaxStep","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L483-L491"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">nrm2_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2\">nrm2</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Finish\">nrm2Finish</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Fold.html#Nat.fold\">fold</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Step\">nrm2Step</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`nrm2 x` is `nrm2Finish` of the sums of the scaled squares, accumulated from the left by\n`nrm2Step`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2_eq","kind":"theorem","line":471,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L471-L479"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">nrm2</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The Euclidean norm `√(x[0] * x[0] + … + x[n - 1] * x[n - 1])`, by Blue's algorithm, as in the\nreference BLAS: it overflows or underflows only when the norm does. It is `0` for the empty vector,\na `NaN` if an element is a `NaN`, and otherwise `∞` if an element is infinite.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2","kind":"def","line":460,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L460-L469"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Loop\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">nrm2Loop</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ho</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.off\">off</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#Nat.toUSize\">toUSize</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">o</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hc</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.inc\">inc</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#Nat.toUSize\">toUSize</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.data\">data</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hm</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">asml </span><span class=\"fn\">amed </span><span class=\"fn\">abig</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The loop of `nrm2` from the index `i`, up to the bound `m`, which is `n`, with the sums `asml`,\n`amed` and `abig`. It keeps them in three loop variables rather than a tuple, which would be\nallocated at every step.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Loop","kind":"def","line":401,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Loop","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L401-L422"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Finish\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">nrm2Finish</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The last step of `nrm2`, from the sums `(asml, amed, abig)` of the squares of the small,\nmid-range and big elements, scaled: it combines the two sums that matter, as the reference BLAS\ndoes, and takes the square root.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Finish","kind":"def","line":380,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Finish","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L380-L399"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Step\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">nrm2Step</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One step of `nrm2`: it adds the square of `|x[i]|`, scaled, to the accumulator of its range, in\nthe sums `(asml, amed, abig)` of the small, mid-range and big elements.\n\nThe reference BLAS stops adding to `asml` after the first big element. That is only a shortcut:\n`asml` is ignored once `abig > 0`, which holds from the first big element on, so the result is the\nsame.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Step","kind":"def","line":364,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Vec.nrm2Step","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L364-L378"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.maxN\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Blue</span>.<span class=\"name\">maxN</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The largest finite `Float32`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.maxN","kind":"def","line":357,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Blue.maxN","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L357-L358"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.sbig\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Blue</span>.<span class=\"name\">sbig</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The factor that scales down the big elements, `2 ^ (-76)`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.sbig","kind":"def","line":354,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Blue.sbig","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L354-L355"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.ssml\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Blue</span>.<span class=\"name\">ssml</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The factor that scales up the small elements, `2 ^ 75`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.ssml","kind":"def","line":351,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Blue.ssml","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Level1.lean#L351-L352"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.tbig\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Blue</span>.<span class=\"name\">tbig</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The threshold for big elements, `2 ^ 52`: their squares may overflow when summed.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Level1.html#BLAS.Float32.Blue.tbig","kind":"def","line":348,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Blue.tbig","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/